WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.211
Today is a short check, and then a game.

2
00:00:02.661 --> 00:00:08.313
There are six new sentences. Three to read and do. Three with two pictures to choose from.

3
00:00:08.763 --> 00:00:14.569
Your child reads each one alone, and does the job. Do not help, and do not read anything out loud.

4
00:00:15.019 --> 00:00:17.363
Mark each one that was done right, and count.

5
00:00:17.813 --> 00:00:19.704
Five or six, go on to day six.

6
00:00:20.154 --> 00:00:25.932
Fewer than five, do days two, three and four again, then come back to this page. That is normal.

7
00:00:26.382 --> 00:00:30.446
Then play the game on the next page. Five lines make one picture.

8
00:00:30.896 --> 00:00:36.012
Your child reads a line, adds it to the drawing, and marks the line. Then the next one.

9
00:00:36.462 --> 00:00:41.918
Every line has to fit with the ones before it. That is what holding a story together means.
